#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:9
msgid "软件与物理验证边界"
msgstr "Software and physical validation boundaries"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:11
msgid ""
"一个结果只适用于实际检查的源码、配置、工具、环境和产物。页面或代码存在不建立执行通过；公开 API、配置可行、Board 授权和真实运行也不能互相替代。"
msgstr ""
"A result applies only to the source, configuration, tools, environment and "
"artifacts actually checked. A page or code file does not establish a passing"
" execution. Public API, configuration feasibility, Board authorization and "
"actual operation are not interchangeable."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:13
msgid "![独立验证范围](../../assets/diagrams/qualification-evidence.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Independent validation scopes](../../assets/diagrams/qualification-"
"evidence.svg)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:13
msgid "独立验证范围"
msgstr "Independent validation scopes"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "范围"
msgstr "Scope"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "需要的实际输入与观察"
msgstr "Required actual inputs and observations"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "结论边界"
msgstr "Conclusion boundary"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "Native/GoogleTest"
msgstr "Native/GoogleTest"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "精确源码、选中模型/port、实际案例与新报告"
msgstr "Exact source, selected model/port, actual cases and fresh reports"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "所执行的软件合同"
msgstr "The software contracts exercised"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "ARM ELF/BIN/map"
msgstr "ARM ELF/BIN/map"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "真实编译链接、向量、配置、sections、资源预算"
msgstr ""
"Actual compilation/linking, vectors, configuration, sections and resource "
"budgets"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "镜像与资源关联，不证明MCU已运行"
msgstr "Image and resource association; no proof that an MCU ran"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "搬迁 Source SDK"
msgstr "Relocated Source SDK"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "clean source、锁定依赖、许可/文件映射、独立C/C++消费者"
msgstr ""
"Clean source, locked dependencies, license/file map and independent C/C++ "
"consumers"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "公开include/ABI与实际构建/运行/链接"
msgstr "Public includes/ABI and actual build/run/link"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "文档"
msgstr "Documentation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "当前正文、图源、对应译文、锁定工具、真实提取与构建"
msgstr ""
"Current prose, diagram sources, corresponding translations, locked tools, "
"actual extraction and builds"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "文档自身的内容和交付"
msgstr "Content and delivery of the documentation itself"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "物理 HIL"
msgstr "Physical HIL"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "PCB/芯片/UID/probe/供电/station、同一镜像和负载、原始测量"
msgstr ""
"PCB/chip/UID/probe/power/station, the same image and workload, and raw "
"measurements"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:0
msgid "被观察设备及已声明范围"
msgstr "Observed devices and declared scope"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:23
msgid "源码、配置和产物一起读取"
msgstr "Read source, configuration and artifacts together"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:25
msgid ""
"记录实际完整源码提交和 dirty 状态、作者配置与输入摘要、工具/依赖、命令、退出码、JUnit及镜像/资源身份。开发中的 dirty "
"运行保留真实状态；可发布 Source SDK 从 clean commit 导出并完成自己的字节与消费者检查。"
msgstr ""
"Record the actual complete source commit and dirty state, authored "
"configuration and input digests, tools/dependencies, commands, exit codes, "
"JUnit and image/resource identities. Development runs with dirty sources "
"retain their actual state. A publishable Source SDK is exported from a clean"
" commit and passes its own byte and consumer checks."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:27
msgid ""
"软件结果不自动授予另一个配置、源码或产品。文档源码与被描述代码的身份分别记录；修改正文不会重新执行平台测试。相同版本号也不能替代相同字节、代际或ABI。"
msgstr ""
"Software results do not automatically qualify another configuration, source "
"or product. Record documentation and described-code identities separately; "
"changing prose does not rerun platform tests. Matching version numbers do "
"not replace matching bytes, generations or ABI."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:29
msgid "不完整与失败结果"
msgstr "Incomplete and failed results"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:31
msgid "空报告、skipped-only、陈旧输出、缺少原件、改动输入或中断运行不能作为完整通过。保留原始失败与后续重试，不把已失败的尝试改成成功。"
msgstr ""
"Empty reports, skipped-only executions, stale outputs, missing originals, "
"changed inputs and interrupted runs cannot count as complete passes. Retain "
"original failures and later retries; never relabel a failed attempt as "
"successful."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:33
msgid ""
"描述复核、编译/链接、模型行为、物理路径和产品负载是独立维度。一个UART IRQ结果不能推导同板SPI "
"DMA、另一个后端或任意负载。验收规则见[接入合同](../contracts/integration.md)，实际能力由[精确支持](support.md)与配置查询确定。"
msgstr ""
"Document review, compilation/linking, model behavior, physical paths and "
"product workloads are independent dimensions. One UART IRQ result cannot "
"establish same-board SPI DMA, another backend or any workload. See the "
"[integration contract](../contracts/integration.md) for acceptance rules; "
"[exact support](support.md) and configuration queries determine actual "
"capabilities."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:35
msgid "当前物理状态"
msgstr "Current physical status"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:37
msgid ""
"当前 MCU 物理 HIL 为 "
"`not_executed`。启动/时钟精度、IRQ/DMA时序、电气安全输出、Flash掉电、上下文保持、栈峰值、吞吐与功耗需要实际设备执行。HIL "
"fixture、station template、预算或源码不能填补这些观测。"
msgstr ""
"Current MCU physical HIL is `not_executed`. Startup/clock accuracy, IRQ/DMA "
"timing, electrical safe outputs, Flash power loss, context retention, peak "
"stack use, throughput and power require actual device execution. HIL "
"fixtures, station templates, budgets and source code cannot supply these "
"observations."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/platforms/qualification.md:39
msgid ""
"新实现运行其适用门禁并保留源码/配置身份。性能测量方法和物理工装使用[测量指南](../../guides/performance-"
"hil.md)，产品负责负载、限值、签名、制造与现场发布政策。"
msgstr ""
"New implementations run their applicable gates and retain "
"source/configuration identities. Use the [measurement "
"guide](../../guides/performance-hil.md) for performance methods and physical"
" fixtures. Products own workloads, limits, signatures, manufacturing and "
"field-release policy."
